// CONFORMANCE-CASE
// spec: 13-expression-semantics
// facility: [Deref] (the operand is a reference, a guard or a raw pointer); conf.deref-non-reference
// kind: negative
// expect: diag.type-mismatch (static)
//
// `*3` dereferences an integer, which is no reference: rejected before
// the program runs (it had reached `coby`'s evaluator, and `cobc`'s code
// generator, before this case was added).

import std;

fn main()
{
    i32 x = *3;
    printf("%v\n", x);
}
